Biblical Kingdoms Map: third-party notices

Scripture
  Scripture references in the app link out to BibleGateway (https://www.biblegateway.com),
  using the NRSVUE text on their site. No Bible text is bundled in this repository.
  If verse text is ever quoted in this project, it will be from a public-domain
  translation: the King James Version (KJV) or the World English Bible (WEB).

Sources and references
  Each kingdom, route, city and era links to the sources it was written from:
  Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0 for the linked articles), Encyclopaedia Britannica,
  museum and academic pages, and UN, treaty and other primary documents.
  These are links only; their content is not copied into the repository.
  Map outlines are hand-drawn approximations made for this project. They are not
  traced from any atlas, and are not surveyed borders.

Software
  The app is built with React (MIT) and Vite (MIT). Testing and the PDF guide use
  Playwright (Apache-2.0) and marked (MIT).
